{
  "format": "weave-p0-conformance-v1",
  "specification": "0.2-draft",
  "profile": "P0",
  "description": "P0 conformance corpus (docs/chapters/pure.rst). Files are relative to examples/. A check case requires ACCEPT or the code of the first diagnostic. A run case checks the file, then calls entry with the JSON array args; budgets not given take the tool defaults, which every case stays well within (fuel 1000000 calls, depth 10000 calls, 65536 bits). It requires VALUE with value, or the code of the fault, exhaustion or invalid run request; usage, where given, is the required fuel used, largest depth and largest integer size (P0-BUDGET-1). Kept apart from manifest.json (weave-conformance-v1), whose readers do not implement these kinds.",
